LanguageData.HE_CouncilFailedText:
The envoys sat around the great table, argued long into the night and voted. {0} of {1} said yes; unity needs {2}.

{3}

You can call the council again in {4} days.

LanguageData.HE_SuccessionText:
The reign of {1} is over: the crown of {0} has passed to {2}.

The new ruler is {3}

A new ruler may review the treaties made with you, and rivals may test the young reign.

LanguageData.HE_WorldFairText:
{1} celebrates the Electric Age with a World Fair: halls of glass and iron lit by thousands of bulbs, where every nation shows the best it can make.

Your colony is invited to send one exhibit. {2}

The exhibit travels to the fair and comes back by drop pod in about {3} days, with a prize that grows with its quality. A masterwork or legendary piece can win the grand prize. Declining offends the hosts a little.
